: ""}, {"href": "/upimage/17540153470.pdf", "text": "こうちSDGs推進企業の登録が更新されました", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/upimage/17498669540.pdf", "text": "商工中金(高知支店)による、サステナブル経営に関する融資の決定", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/upimage/17498831260.pdf", "text": "四国銀行の「SDGｓ経営サポートプログラム」に策定されました", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/inquiry.html", "text": "お問い合わせフォーム", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/index.html", "text": "採用情報トップ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://jsite.mhlw.go.jp/kochi-roudoukyoku/newpage_00777.html", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://jsite.mhlw.go.jp/kochi-roudoukyoku/hourei_seido_tetsuzuki/shougaisha_koyoutaisaku-monisu.html", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://kochi-sdgs.pref.kochi.lg.jp/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://kochi-wlb.jp/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/index.html", "text": "トップページ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/product/index.html", "text": "事業内容", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/product/gravure.html", "text": "‣グラビア部門", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/product/carton.html", "text": "‣紙器部門", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/product/quality.html", "text": "‣品質管理", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/works/index.html", "text": "制作実績", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/company/index.html", "text": "会社案内", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/company/message.html", "text": "‣代表挨拶", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/company/profile.html", "text": "‣会社情報", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/sustainability/index.html", "text": "サステナビリティ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/sustainability/sdgs.html", "text": "‣SDGsの取り組み", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/inquiry.html", "text": "お問い合わせ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/index.html", "text": "採用情報", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/work.html", "text": "‣仕事を知る", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/voice.html", "text": "‣先輩の声", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/env.html", "text": "‣働く環境", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/entryinfo.html", "text": "‣募集要項", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/entry.htm